<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Continental Air started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Continental Air started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg analyst Timothy Ross said he initiated coverage of Continental Airlines Inc as an &quot;add.&quot;</p>
<p>-- expects Continental to earn $4.57 a share in 1997 and $5.08 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- cited Continental's revenue growth potential, cash flow generation and hidden assets, such as its 12.4 percent stake in Amadeus and its 91 percent interest in Continental Micronesia.</p>
<p>-- said company is positioned as an attractive acquisition candidate in the event of a long-awaited industry consolidation.</p>
<p>-- Continental lost 1/4 to 34-7/8.</p>
</text>
